<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>历史 on 凌虚 Blog</title><link>https://lingxu.pages.dev/tags/%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2/</link><description>Recent content in 历史 on 凌虚 Blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><copyright>Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0)</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 13:02:35 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://lingxu.pages.dev/tags/%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Kubernetes 编年史：从 Borg 到云原生操作系统</title><link>https://lingxu.pages.dev/kubernetes-chronicle/</link><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 11:40:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://lingxu.pages.dev/kubernetes-chronicle/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;如果把数据中心想象成一座港口，容器是标准化的货柜，那么 &lt;code&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/code&gt; 就是港口调度系统：决定哪艘船停哪个泊位、货柜怎么装卸、坏了怎么换、忙了怎么扩。它并不制造货柜，却决定货柜能不能规模化地运转起来。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>